
%% Achernar — Real-Time Control & Telemetry (Sequence)
%% Save as docs/achernar-sequence.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User (Browser/PWA)
  participant Web as Web App (Django API)
  participant Sig as Signaling/TURN
  participant Edge as Edge Node
  participant Cam as Camera/Drivers

  User->>Web: Change exposure to 90s (UI)
  Web->>Sig: Send control message (DataChannel)
  Sig->>Edge: Deliver command (WebRTC)
  Edge->>Cam: SetExposure(90s)
  Cam-->>Edge: OK
  Edge-->>Sig: Ack + New Telemetry (metrics JSON)
  Edge-->>Sig: Live Video (H.264/MJPEG)
  Sig-->>Web: Forward video + telemetry
  Web-->>User: Update UI (live view + metrics)

  rect rgba(200,200,255,0.1)
    Note over Edge,Web: If LAN-only (offline), WebRTC hop is replaced by direct WS/HTTP between Browser and Edge
  end

  Note over Edge: Latency budget<br/>Control: 10–50ms<br/>Metrics: 100–500ms<br/>Video: 200–800ms (network dependent)
